            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adds Throne to the &quot;Open with&quot; list for config files such as JSON and YAML, re-applying the registration whenever the install is moved.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turning this off does not undo an existing registration: use Uninstall for that.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
